forecasting using thousands of news-based sentiment values&lt;/strong&gt;. &lt;em&gt;International Journal of
Forecasting&lt;/em&gt;, 35, 1370–1386.

&lt;a href=&#34;https://doi.org/10.1016/j.ijforecast.2018.10.010&#34; target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;&gt;doi:10.1016/j.ijforecast.2018.10.010&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
